    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "text": "...My head hurts.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fuze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "There you are, big guy. Here, ice for that bump on your head.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4126_fuze_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Y-You're the kid who attacked me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fuze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Call me a kid again, and you'll get another bump on the back of your head.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4126_fuze_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What happened?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fuze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4124_iana_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "They found the meds they lost, so the misunderstanding with us has been resolved...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Iana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4126_fuze_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Meds? Misunderstanding? Resolved?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fuze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4125_rdoc_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It wasn't so hard persuading that poor driver to cooperate, after all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Doc"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4126_fuze_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wha... I'm even more confused now... where are we?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fuze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4125_rdoc_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come, see for yourself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Doc"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "48_g8_slums",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4124_iana_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Here's your medicine. Careful with it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_001"
    },
    {
        "text": "Th-Thank you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Community Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4124_iana_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's your name? Check it off the list.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Iana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_001"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mike... there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Community Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4124_iana_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Two portions left.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4124_iana_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let me check the list again. Maybe someone forgot to come... see if anyone hasn't signed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Iana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#6$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "text": "The last two are mine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Here you go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "*cough* I-I'm sorry about today. We didn't know someone else was behind the robbery...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's ok. Glad to see that the medicine ended up in the hands of those who need it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gustave told me that a lot of people here are afflicted with a special condition that requires these suppressants to control.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "So... wasn't that Capit\u00e1n at odds with Reynell? Why is he stealing our meds to suck up to Reynell now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mi\u0142osz told me that he's after Reynell's development rights in this district.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "And what if he gets it? Reynell had the rights himself, and he couldn't do anything about us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good thing too. It would be a shame if the local culture here got replaced by hotels and casinos.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've only been here half a day, and you're talking like you know the place well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "And in this half a day, everyone who came for their medicine was trying to promote their artwork to me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "People have to eat, after all... what's that on your arm?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "A braided wristband. I didn't plan on buying it, but then I saw the kid's hands full of needle marks...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Whisper) Who could be so clumsy?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "What did you say?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Uhh... I mean... would you like to take a break in my workshop?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
