    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "34_g6_noblelivingroom",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "key": "$darkness_03_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_223"
    },
    {
        "text": "50 million Columbian gold certificates! 50 million going once, 50 million going twice!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Auction Host"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sold for 50 million gold certificates!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Auction Host"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "What did you say? The warehouse that kept losing stuff? Which one?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "The one from the pharmaceutical company that shut down six months after you acquired it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I seem to remember something of the sort... so, some people stole meds meant for that neighborhood, framed you for it, then tried to sneak those meds into that warehouse.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "To be precise, they tried to frame <i>you</i>.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you want me to do, then? Thank you for resolving the misunderstanding?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's no need for that, Mr. Reynell.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mi\u0142osz says you're leaving the accommodations I arranged for you. Have you found your friends?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, we just found another place to stay.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "That neighborhood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "There? Not that I'm against it or anything, but why?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I saw something interesting.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
