    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "48_g9_gangsters",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "cameraeffect",
        "effect": "Grayscale",
        "amount": 0.8,
        "keep": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "key": "$normal_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is my workshop. There's a lot of space here. I work together with other artists, looking for inspiration, sometimes exhibiting our work.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are those wet papers abandoned drafts?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, they're finished artwork.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Finished?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's a guy who leaves his paintings outside and lets the rain dissolve the paint. The work isn't finished until that step is done.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#10$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "text": "The man who's flexing his muscles... is he looking for inspiration?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Strictly speaking, he's a work of art too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Performance art?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Read the plaque in front of him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Name: Pepe Turri\u00f3n. Artist: Pepe Turri\u00f3n's parents.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Description: Six months after creating this work, the artists abandoned it in the suburbs of Dossoles due to lack of economic value.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Little could they imagine that Pepe Turri\u00f3n would become one of the greatest masterpieces of Dossoles twenty years later. Eat shit, jerks.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#10$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wow...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_492_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am the greatest Originium Artist in Dossoles. Would you like to see my Arts?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Solemn Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4126_fuze_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is he better than you, Tecno?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fuze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No one's better, when it comes to Originium Arts.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4126_fuze_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fuze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Be careful and don't hurt our guests.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_492_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Solemn Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The man takes out a few dark crystals from his pocket, each one glowing with an orange-yellow light. The visitors cautiously take a few steps back."
    },
    {
        "text": "The pure Originium Prime crystals begin to spin in the man's palm. Then, he tosses them into the air one by one."
    },
    {
        "text": "He begins to juggle pure Originium."
    },
    {
        "text": "After a few rounds, he tosses all of them into the air at the same time, then looks up and catches the first one with his nose."
    },
    {
        "text": "Then the next, and the next... finally, all the crystals form a tower on the tip of his nose."
    },
    {
        "text": "The man turns slightly, and the tower of pure Originium slides back into his palm."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4124_iana_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I thought Arts was about flashing lights and fireballs... that's Originium Arts?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Iana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_492_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What is this, if not Originium? What did I demonstrate, if not arts?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Solemn Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4124_iana_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... see...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Iana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#9$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "text": "We're here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "text": "My biggest work lies beyond this door.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4125_rdoc_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I think I've said this not too long ago, but I want to say it again\u2014nothing could surprise me now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Doc"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$dooropenquite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Two mannequin heads? So big?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Those are just the heads. You haven't seen the bodies yet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "text": "They'll be dancing the night our arts festival begins.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "text": "They will dance when the twin moons begin to set, and the sunlight has yet to shine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "text": "They will be the center of attention, the stars of the show. They will turn and pirouette on the streets, stepping in tune and gracing the entire community.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4126_fuze_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "A beautiful picture.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fuze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sure many people will be dancing with them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, maybe...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I don't know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4124_iana_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't know?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Iana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nobody has danced in a long time, ever since that dance hall fire.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
