        "fadetime": 0,
        "amount": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "34_g6_noblelivingroom",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "key": "$darkness_03_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I told you, they've got innovative structures, deep emotions, delicate expressions.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Interesting... you've piqued my interest in what those people are doing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you're going to that neighborhood, will you see what they're doing on my behalf?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I thought you weren't happy that they planned their arts festival on the same day as your opening ceremony.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doesn't mean I can't be interested in what they're doing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can observe what they're doing on your behalf, but I have no reason to intervene in your conflict with them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course not! Not that I wouldn't appreciate it if you could convince them to change the date.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't make you any promises.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You can't succeed if you don't try.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Anyway, I'm surprised you're willing to learn more about what they're doing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You wouldn't be surprised if you were willing to learn more about me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I thought...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#6$1",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "text": "Collection No. 257, antique music box, starting price 15 million gold certificates. Any bidders?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Auction Host"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#10$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shh... I have to focus.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Raises bid card)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#10$1",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "text": "20 million! Anyone else? 20 million!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Auction Host"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#10$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Raises bid card)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#10$1",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "text": "Er... same bidder to 25 million?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Auction Host"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#10$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Raises bid card)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's no one bidding against you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#10$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Raises bid card)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't care what anyone else bids. I just want to raise it to the price I think it's worth.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
