    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkness01_intro",
        "key": "$darkness01_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1210_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I-I apologize for my rash decision...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mateo"
    },
    {
        "text": "But we didn't think they would have the nerve to openly insult Coalition government forces that...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mateo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1210_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I-I understand! Next time\u2014there won't be a next time!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mateo"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll accept any punishment if this happens again! You can fire me, court-martial me, anything!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mateo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_telephone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1271_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Capit\u00e1n...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Commanding Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1210_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shut up. Now the brass knows about that stupid truck driver.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mateo"
    },
    {
        "text": "They stripped him naked and dropped him at our front door. The brass considers it an open insult to the Coalition government.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mateo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1210_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "They asked whether our relationship with Reynell can continue, whether there is hope of obtaining the land. What am I supposed to say?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mateo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1210_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stupid, incompetent idiots.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mateo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1271_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Capit\u00e1n, Reynell's secretary is here... do you want to see him?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Commanding Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1210_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Show him in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mateo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$dooropenquite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1210_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you're just here to complain on Reynell's behalf, you can save it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mateo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course not, Mr. Mateo. Reynell is satisfied with your efficiency. You were just a little... reckless.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "text": "There are many Infected in that community. Stealing their medicine is one way to take them down. But you must understand that, if many Infected die because of it...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Making a big mess does none of us any good.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1210_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We understand. What else did he tell you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mateo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What he means is that, if you were too reckless before, perhaps a more cautious approach now can bring about a peaceful resolution.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1210_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've gotten to this point, and you want me to negotiate with those people?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mateo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, Mr. Mateo. There's no need for you to worry about it. Mr. Reynell has already sent someone to do it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1210_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mateo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Miss Ela and her squad.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're familiar with them, no? Your men have had dealings with them, and people have even confused them with your men.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1210_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We have an agreement, Mi\u0142osz. Don't forget it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mateo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No need to get excited, Mr. Mateo. Reynell doesn't intend to terminate his cooperation with you. He just asks for cooler heads.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "text": "We can talk about the land once you're calm enough to do so.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is there any message that you would like me to deliver to Mr. Reynell?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1210_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mateo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I take my leave, then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1210_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You were playing games with me, weren't you, Reynell?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mateo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1210_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're dead, Reynell, DEAD, if I don't get that piece of land from you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mateo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "48_g8_slums",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "key": "$normal_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4124_iana_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "150 million? He bid a music box to 150 million on his own?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Iana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "He may be eccentric, but he shows respect to what he considers art, in his own way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4124_iana_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "It sounds like you're starting to change your mind about him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Iana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've never made up my mind about him, Meijer. He's not easy to make up your mind about.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4124_iana_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that what makes him interesting?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Iana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll admit that he's not your traditional, boring art dealer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4124_iana_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's saying quite a bit, coming from you. You're not big on compliments usually.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Iana"
    },
    {
        "text": "What now? Will you continue to work with him?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Iana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not sure... but I'll think about it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4124_iana_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come to think of it, we couldn't have adapted to this place so quickly without his help.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Iana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "We did save his life, so we're even on that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4124_iana_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "*sigh*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Iana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#6$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, Ela... do you have a moment?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course. What is it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Pap\u00e1 wants to see you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mr. Diaz? Why?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "He has some questions for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Very well, I'll go and see him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "And just so you know... he might act pretty... angry.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "He wants to intimidate me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "He may not admit it, but... yes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
